<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-006" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:plums" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:plums:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>七歳，嘗與諸小兒遊，看道邊李樹多子折枝，諸兒競走取之，唯<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:plums:m0030" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>不動。人問之，答曰：「樹在道邊而多子，此必苦李。」取之信然。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:tiger" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:tiger:m0000" ref="932_46f_026">魏明帝</persName>於宣武塲上斷虎爪牙，縱百姓觀之。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:tiger:m0019" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>七歳，亦往看。虎承閒攀欄而吼，其聲震地，觀者無不辟易顛仆；<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:tiger:m0050" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>湛然不動，了無恐色。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:zhulin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:zhulin:m0000" ref="932_46f_026">明帝</persName>自閣上望見，使人問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin043-wangrong:zhulin:m0011" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>姓名而異之。</p>
</text>
